r to a chair to a paper closet. A tag is a specific NFC tag that is added to the REST API through the app, which collects the tag's uuid and matches it with a specific location, device type, and description. A check happens when in the Check Activity and scan an NFC tag; the scan registers the tag's uuid and matches it to a specific tag in the database, and if it is valid, you can give a certain status and short description of the tag's current state.","topics":[],"score":207739,"global_rank":289641},{"name":"goelakash/QuoraWeb","owner":"goelakash","html_url":"https://github.com/goelakash/QuoraWeb","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"An simple WebView alternative for Quora on android.","topics":[],"score":207739,"global_rank":289643},{"name":"programmingandlogic/target-hjpenark154","owner":"programmingandlogic","html_url":"https://github.com/programmingandlogic/target-hjpenark154","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"target-hjpenark154 created by GitHub Classroom","topics":[],"score":207739,"global_rank":289644},{"name":"williw3/Ninja-Gold","owner":"williw3","html_url":"https://github.com/williw3/Ninja-Gold","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"The classic Dojo game, Java/Spring","topics":[],"score":207738,"global_rank":289651},{"name":"developer-vs/zoom_animations","owner":"developer-vs","html_url":"https://github.com/developer-vs/zoom_animations","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"Example of zoom plus and zoom minus animations.","topics":["android","animations"],"score":207738,"global_rank":289655},{"name":"afreakyelf/customadapterlist","owner":"afreakyelf","html_url":"https://github.com/afreakyelf/customadapterlist","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":207738,"global_rank":289677},{"name":"afreakyelf/sci-cal","owner":"afreakyelf","html_url"